    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15928" root="رعن" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَعْنٌ</span></b>  <i>A prominence,</i> or <i>projecting part,</i> (S, K,)
or <i>such as is large,</i> (TA,) <i>of a mountain:</i> (S, K:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُعُونٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِعَانٌ</span>. (S, K.) And <i>A long mountain:</i> (K:) or, accord. to Lth, <i>a mountain that is
not long:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُعُونٌ</span>. (TA.)

